  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Spray Magic Party is your ultimate must-have for radiance, care, and an incredible fragrance!</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-07.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>Immerse yourself in a party-like vibe from within: this shimmer body spray combines a delicate perfumed fragrance, skincare benefits, and a soft shimmer on the skin — without any stickiness or greasy shine.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-05.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>Bronze glitter:</strong> Food-grade shimmering particles create a subtle glow that enhances your skin’s natural beauty and makes it stand out in any light.</p>\n<p><strong>Coffee extract: </strong>Helps stimulate circulation, boosting skin tone and delivering a healthy appearance.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-06.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>Perfect for evening events, photoshoots, special occasions, or whenever you want to infuse a touch of \"wow-effect\" into your everyday life.</p>\n<p><strong>Volume:</strong> 155 ml — the perfect size for daily use, delivering a long-lasting fragrance and an enduring glow.</p>\n </div>\n</div>",
